.TH BLACKJACK 6.SH NAMEblackjack \- Las Vegas blackjack in BASIC09.SH SYNOPSIS\fBrunb blackjack\fR.SH DESCRIPTIONBlackjack against the dealer.  It asks your name and whether you wantthe rules, then takes a wager and deals.  RETURN draws a card,\fBs\fRstands,\fBd\fRdoubles down and\fBx\fRsplits a pair.  A wager of 0 ends the game..SH NOTESBASIC09 I-code: run it with Microware's\fBrunb\fRloaded, by the bare module name.\fBblackjak\fRis the SNOBOL4-in-C blackjack, a different program..SH SEE ALSOblackjak, bjack